direction: down
history: "Declared map/capture workload history\nretention, mutation, replay and GC triggers\nno assumed benchmark numbers"
gain: "Potential removed work G\nrepeat mature copying\nfull mature saved-graph minor traversal"
added: "Added / retained work A\npromotion and early stabilization\nbarriers / roots / logs / access\nmajor work / phases / restore copies"
history -> gain
history -> added
gate: "Time benefit condition\nG > A\nrobust interval: lower(G) > upper(A)"
gain -> gate
added -> gate
semantics: "Semantic conditions\nall roots and writers / dynamic aliases\nmulti-shot replay / wind / code lifetime"
gate -> semantics
coordinates: "Separate acceptance coordinates\nserial time / pauses / throughput\npeak memory / FFI / diagnosability"
semantics -> coordinates
learn: "Learning from OCaml\nmechanisms, constraints and tradeoffs\nreflect on Gambit's own frame/control graph"
learn -> history
decision: "Research decision\nkeep useful lazy capture and general Scheme control\nredesign where coverage or total benefit fails"
coordinates -> decision
